     "md": "Count each group. Look at the two numbers. The bigger number is **more**. The smaller number is **less**."
    },
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "pieges",
     "title": "Common mistakes",
     "md": "- A big thing is not always more things. Count them.\n- Small to big goes **up**: 2, 5, 9.\n- Big to small goes **down**: 9, 5, 2."
    },
    {
     "type": "example",
     "title": "Example 1",
     "statement": "Group A has 6 balls. Group B has 4 balls. Which has more?",
     "steps": [
      "Count A: 6. Count B: 4.",
