     "style": "definition",
     "title": "Even and odd",
     "md": "**Even** numbers can be put in pairs with none left over: 2, 4, 6, 8, 10. **Odd** numbers have one left over: 1, 3, 5, 7, 9."
    },
    {
     "type": "illustration",
     "figure": {
