      "h": 110
     },
     "caption": "Eight balls make four pairs. Eight is even.",
     "alt": "Eight blue circles in two rows of four."
    },
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "retenir",
     "title": "Skip counting",
     "md": "In twos: 2, 4, 6, 8, 10. In fives: 5, 10, 15, 20. In tens: 10, 20, 30, 40."
    },
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "pieges",
     "title": "Common mistakes",
     "md": "- 0 is even.\n- Check the last digit: 0, 2, 4, 6, 8 means even.\n- Do not skip a number when you count in fives."
